{"ticker":"LH","updated":"2026-10-30T22:56:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Labcorp Holdings Inc.","shortName":"Labcorp Holdings Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.labcorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":71000,"marketCap":29344868352,"trailingPE":29.622133,"forwardPE":18.476908,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.01068,"pegRatio":1.43,"targetMeanPrice":376.875,"targetHighPrice":420.0,"targetLowPrice":309.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.069,"earningsGrowth":0.032,"grossMargins":0.28964,"operatingMargins":0.10971,"profitMargins":0.06879,"totalRevenue":14594499584,"beta":0.846,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":371.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":244.52,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.78},"summary":"Labcorp Holdings Inc. provides laboratory services. It operates in Diagnostics Laboratories and Biopharma Laboratory Services segments. The company offers various tests, such as blood chemistry analyses, urinalyses, blood cell counts, thyroid tests, PAP tests, hemoglobin A1C, PSA, tests for sexually transmitted diseases, vitamin D testing, microbiology cultures and procedures, and alcohol and other substance abuse tests. It also provides specialty testing services comprising gene-based and esoteric testing; advanced tests target specific diseases; services related to anatomic pathology/oncology, cardiovascular disease, coagulation, diagnostic genetics, endocrinology, infectious disease, women's health, pharmacogenetics, parentage and donor testing, occupational testing service, medical drug monitoring services, chronic disease programs, and kidney stone prevention tests; and health and wellness services to employers and managed care organizations. In addition, it offers digital pathology solutions, a pathology platforms that support the digitization, centralized review, and sharing of pathology slides; provider and payer digital platforms, an online applications for providers, MCOs, and ACOs; online and mobile applications that enable patients to check offerings, schedule PSC visits, check-in upon PSC arrival, complete documentation, access tests and test results, and manage th","summary_zh":"Labcorp Holdings Inc. 提供實驗室服務。它在診斷實驗室和生物製藥實驗室服務領域運作。該公司提供各種測試，例如血液化學分析、尿液分析、血球計數、甲狀腺測試、PAP 測試、A1C 血紅蛋白、PSA、性傳染病測試、維生素 D 測試、微生物培養和程序以及酒精和其他藥物濫用測試。它還提供專業測試服務，包括基於基因和深奧的測試；針對特定疾病的高級測試；與解剖病理學/腫瘤學、心血管疾病、凝血、診斷遺傳學、內分泌學、傳染病、婦女健康、藥物遺傳學、親子和捐贈者檢測、職業檢測服務、醫療藥物監測服務、慢性病計畫和腎結石檢測相關的服務；為雇主和管理式醫療組織提供醫療保健服務。此外，還提供數位病理解決方案，即支援病理切片數位化、集中審閱、共享的病理平台；提供者和付款人數位平台，面向提供者、MCO 和 ACO 的線上應用程式；線上和行動應用程式使患者能夠檢查產品、安排 PSC 就診、在 PSC 到達時登記、完整文件、訪問測試和測試結果以及管理","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":275.97,"h":277.47,"l":273.6,"c":273.78,"v":653700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":272.56,"h":274.99,"l":271.18,"c":273.84,"v":383600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":275.18,"h":275.49,"l":272.38,"c":275.23,"v":321900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":275.23,"h":279.03,"l":273.94,"c":278.67,"v":279700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":278.36,"h":278.96,"l":273.28,"c":277.21,"v":669200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":277.5,"h":279.0,"l":275.02,"c":278.11,"v":404800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":277.44,"h":277.57,"l":272.48,"c":272.94,"v":462700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":273.89,"h":281.69,"l":270.0,"c":279.72,"v":368400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":278.85,"h":280.84,"l":277.71,"c":277.95,"v":347200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":277.46,"h":278.04,"l":274.25,"c":275.4,"v":427000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":275.4,"h":277.0,"l":273.88,"c":274.09,"v":410900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":274.09,"h":278.44,"l":273.53,"c":276.07,"v":399600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":274.22,"h":278.63,"l":274.22,"c":277.15,"v":412600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":277.68,"h":278.53,"l":276.04,"c":277.27,"v":1064800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":276.03,"h":279.75,"l":275.06,"c":278.9,"v":540600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":278.9,"h":283.47,"l":278.77,"c":279.94,"v":471700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":279.85,"h":282.22,"l":278.46,"c":279.35,"v":366500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":277.94,"h"