1dnS3A3X1JBMl9MaFB5SVkxSy1UVGN3NGJMYzJnZmVnQ3Vrb1FGdUFrLW0zTWJjYlB5Zk50cm1XZE5PeEVjaGNKOGI2UjZ0MUJNamdpamJNMkZYWHFwbm9KTFVwLVFyQThmd05jd3NLaGpLcmJCRG1memNFa1pNSUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Labcorp (LH) 2026 年第三季：獲利超出預期，上調指引，四筆交易待定"},{"title":"Labcorp shares edge up on beating estimates, raising guidance","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQUEFDZTdiRml1YTFJZlBlUEVPZ0xJV0lKUnNVam1hb1QzM01CUHBYVnlDaVM1TnYxZjhaeHBvN2I1RjlSRFZBaHdlYVM5WmlDak5iUlk3YWZQVVFzMUt1dnJ4NEJiZ000Sy1lbVdMUUIyZjFFdnlqbkZ4VzBkbEFiaTVSa2JSMmhEcllHeVlfeW15MENlUTQzczI5Smh0WHlHT2RlQ1B5NWJxLVAyTUc0cldIdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Labcorp 股價小幅上漲，超乎預期，提高指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/920148/000092014826000111/lh-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Labcorp Holdings Inc. is a global leader of innovative and comprehensive laboratory services that provides vital information to help doctors, hospitals, pharmaceutical companies, researchers, and patients make clear and confident decisions. The Company provides insights and accelerates innovations to improve health and improve lives through its unparalleled diagnostics and drug development laboratory capabilities. During 2025, the Company's nearly 71,000 employees served clients in approximately 100 countries and performed more than 750 million tests for patients around the world. In addition, the Company provided support for more than 85% of the new drugs and therapeutic products approved in 2025 by the FDA.","zh":"Labcorp Holdings Inc. 是創新和綜合實驗室服務的全球領導者，提供重要資訊以幫助醫生、醫院、製藥公司、研究人員和患者做出清晰而自信的決策。該公司透過其無與倫比的診斷和藥物開發實驗室能力提供見解並加速創新，以改善健康和改善生活。 2025年，公司近71,000名員工為約100個國家的客戶提供服務，並為全球患者進行了超過7.5億次檢測。此外，該公司也為FDA 2025年核准的85%以上的新藥和治療產品提供了支持。"},{"en":"The Company's strength in science, technology, and innovation, as well as its global scale, powers its continued success, differentiates the Company, and enables it to play a leading role in advancing healthcare across the globe. These strengths are critical to the Company's ability to carry out its mission to improve health and improve lives.","zh":"公司在科學、技術和創新方面的實力以及全球規模，推動了公司的持續成功，使公司脫穎而出，並使其能夠在推動全球醫療保健方面發揮主導作用。這些優勢對於公司履行改善健康和改善生活的使命的能力至關重要。"},{"en":"Through leadership in science, technology and innovation, the Company provides vital information and services to help its customers make clear and confident decisions to improve health and improve lives.","zh":"透過在科學、技術和創新方面的領先地位，該公司提供重要的資訊和服務，幫助客戶做出明確、自信的決策，以改善健康並改善生活。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The Company's global talent is core to its ability to innovate and meet a wide range of patient and customer needs. The Company's employees are globally dispersed, with 89% in the U.S. and Canada, 5% in Asia, and 6% in Europe at December 31, 2025. Of the Company's global workforce, 87% of employees are full-time, and 13% are part-time. Approximately 71% of the Company's employees globally are women. Of the U.S.-based employees, approximately 53% of the team are non-Caucasian. Approximately 3% of the Company's global workforce is employed under a collective bargaining agreement. To maintain operational flexibility and respond to changing business demand and talent availability, the Company supplements its workforce with contingent workers, who represent up to an additional 8% of the total workforce.","zh":"該公司的全球人才是其創新和滿足廣泛患者和客戶需求的能力的核心。截至2025年12月31日，公司員工分佈在全球，其中89%在美國和加拿大，5%在亞洲，6%在歐洲。在公司全球員工隊伍中，87%的員工是全職員工，13%是兼職員工。公司全球約 71% 的員工是女性。在美國員工中，大約 53% 的團隊成員是非白人。公司全球約有 3% 的員工是根據集體談判協議受僱的。為了保持營運靈活性並應對不斷變化的業務需求和人才供應，公司透過臨時工補充其員工隊伍，臨時工佔員工總數的 8%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Diagnostics","val":10876500000,"zh":"診斷"},{"name":"Biopharma Laboratory Services","val":3098200000,"zh":"生物製藥實驗室服務"}],"total":13951700000}},"peers":["DGX","WAT","UHS","IQV","MTD"]}}